#. module: ems
#: model:ir.model,name:ems.model_ems_limesurvey_enrollment
msgid ""
"LimeSurvey enrollment: contains a copy of the enrollment model for the "
"related student, in order to allow changes on the fly when preparing the "
"surveys (only secretarial staff should be allowed to modify the real "
"enrollments)."
