msgid ""
"This closes the outgoing course and opens the next one for the\n"
"                                studies you select. It freezes the academic history, turns the\n"
"                                graduates who leave into archived alumni, turns the graduates\n"
"                                whose enrollment is not confirmed yet into applicants that keep\n"
"                                their portal access, places everyone else into the destination\n"
